  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "RendererBehaviour is the core engine component managing the entire rendering pipeline for an entity. It abstracts WebGL complexities, handling state setup (culling, depth, blending), shader management, and executing draw calls for meshes. It supports advanced features like render-to-texture via Framebuffer Objects and provides utility methods for drawing basic primitives like points and lines."
  },
